{"slug":"transport-mobility","name":"Transport & Mobility","subs":["Airport Transfers","Scooter Rental","Car Rental","Taxis & Ride Hailing","Ferries & Boats"],"seo":"Getting around Cebu: airport transfers to Mactan and the city, scooter rental for the south, car and van hire with a driver, and the ferry piers for Bohol, Negros and Camotes. Listings show what a fair rate looks like and whether a licence or a deposit is required — useful before you agree to a price at the terminal.","subSeo":{"Airport Transfers":"Pre-booked pickups from Mactan airport to the city, Mactan resorts and the south.","Scooter Rental":"Scooter and motorbike hire by the day, week or month — the practical way to see the south.","Car Rental":"Self-drive and with-driver car and van hire, including airport delivery.","Taxis & Ride Hailing":"Taxi fleets and ride-hailing options, plus what a fair metered fare looks like.","Ferries & Boats":"Piers and ferry operators for Bohol, Negros, Camotes and Leyte — schedules and terminals."},"items":[{"id":"ChIJkwOQZdzpqzMRyNoZKbdc5Qc","name":"LOY'S MOTORBIKE RENTAL","tier":"Verified","subs":["Scooter Rental"],"sub":"Scooter Rental","area":"Moalboal","address":"Panagsama, Bantayan, 1 Tubli Rd, Moalboal, 6032 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"5","reviews":"276","lat":9.954999899999999,"lng":123.3692002,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=LOY'S%20MOTORBIKE%20RENTAL&query_place_id=ChIJkwOQZdzpqzMRyNoZKbdc5Qc","website":"","instagram":"","phone":"+63 921 590 7320","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"Loy's Motorbike Rental in Moalboal stands out for its warm, exceptionally professional, and customer-centric atmosphere. Key highlights include pristine, well-maintained scooters, personalized driving lessons for complete beginners, and helpful local travel recommendations. Practical tip: Easily arrange bookings, flexible rental extensions, hotel deliveries, and convenient bus stop drop-offs via WhatsApp or Messenger.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJCYCJCiXpqzMReZFG1LkSNFY","name":"Cebu baktas tourist transport","tier":"Verified","subs":["Airport Transfers"],"sub":"Airport Transfers","area":"Moalboal","address":"W9WG+6H, Moalboal, Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"5","reviews":"142","lat":9.9457132,"lng":123.3763004,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Cebu%20baktas%20tourist%20transport&query_place_id=ChIJCYCJCiXpqzMReZFG1LkSNFY","website":"","instagram":"","phone":"+63 997 445 6203","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"Cebu Baktas Tourist Transport provides an exceptionally smooth, reliable, and stress-free travel experience across Cebu. Travelers consistently praise drivers like Loyd for their punctuality, safe driving, spotless air-conditioned vehicles, and friendly local insights. Practical tip: in addition to comfortable transfers to destinations like Moalboal or Liloan port, the team can also seamlessly help organize local activities such as canyoneering tours.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJn55Whjmh2wMRwT-DKT2-G7I","name":"BN Cebu Selfdrive Car Rental","tier":"Verified","subs":["Car Rental"],"sub":"Car Rental","area":"Mactan","address":"631 Dad Cleland Ave, Looc, Lapu-Lapu, 6015 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"5","reviews":"78","lat":10.3095973,"lng":123.9469322,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=BN%20Cebu%20Selfdrive%20Car%20Rental&query_place_id=ChIJn55Whjmh2wMRwT-DKT2-G7I","website":"https://bncarrentalcebu.com/","instagram":"","phone":"+63 956 390 1481","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"BN Cebu Selfdrive Car Rental offers well-maintained cars including sedans, SUVs, and vans for daily, weekly, or monthly rentals.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJa-1lYiigq